          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বনভোজন — bônbhojôn — \"a picnic\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "শীতে আমরা নদীর পাড়ে বনভোজন করলাম। shīte āmrā nôdīr pāṛe bônbhojôn kôrlām. In winter we had a picnic on the riverbank."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Winter is the season for it in Bengal, with a cook-pot carried out to a field or a riverbank."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বনভোজন (bônbhojôn) joins বন, \"a forest\", Sanskrit vana, to Sanskrit bhojana, \"eating, a meal\" (Monier-Williams for both): a meal out in the woods."
            }
          ]
        },
